{"title":"2000 Pan African MO Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Day_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Day 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Day_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Day 2</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Problem_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 6</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Day_1\">Day 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Day 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/802813cb25bec0d5ac7c616c35a8592516a41e3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/0/44072e3d8c42dcebd549b78ebec931171f53483b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sin^3{x}(1+\\cot{x})+\\cos^3{x}(1+\\tan{x})=\\cos{2x}\\]\" width=\"349\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Define the polynomials <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/f/06f9f506fd37d2c20519f2aa1e6e64530604f4bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_0, P_1, P_2 \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" /> by:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b14812d14e0e33eeeebcee5d710289c818e8f26.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P_0(x)=x^3+213x^2-67x-2000\\]\" width=\"261\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b139439454d86b7e6509dd4b9c7c982fa295206.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P_n(x)=P_{n-1}(x-n), n \\in N\\]\" width=\"222\" height=\"18\" />\nFind the coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/d/18dedd2db531b1c1d2ab93dda470ffb53d079170.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_{21}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be coprime positive integers such that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/5/d1580235bf4edf4971a1d9ac08688804455a85c4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{p}{q}=1-\\frac12+\\frac13-\\frac14 \\cdots -\\dfrac{1}{1334}+\\dfrac{1}{1335}\\]\" width=\"299\" height=\"40\" />\nProve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is divisible by 2003.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Day_2\">Day 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Day 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/6/d86ee296c142d4b84c4e91927de035290e72c326.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2=c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, solve the system:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8e10b07e0442d712042a76bc5c8fb3d570070e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z^2=x^2+y^2\\]\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6c1c4905c1f68d371c4dffdd7a0ab0641b223f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(z+c)^2=(x+a)^2+(y+b)^2\\]\" width=\"230\" height=\"19\" />\nin real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> be circle and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be a point outside <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/377291318df52e4f013ab2bf28ee82454a9e57da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PA$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/9/9f988caff51f7fc88ad40d1d25022c52ffd8f976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PB$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> be the tangents from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> (where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7d222b94139d1bb2d5ca30d2331fa3dd401e37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B \\in \\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />). A line passing through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> intersects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> at points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be a point on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb45550e2441065daf4fcfd0a006bd0beb24bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BS \\parallel QR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"19\" />. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/4333690d7c22bb813e240b055e3ab4e2c27aceb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$SA$\" width=\"25\" height=\"13\" /> bisects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a7c52aff9dd9987076c0ac4fecccf59b6ed8bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>A company has five directors. The regulations of the company require that any majority (three or more) of the directors should be able to open its strongroom, but any minority (two or less) should not be able to do so. The strongroom is equipped with ten locks, so that it can only be opened when keys to all ten locks are available. Find all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that it is possible to give each of the directors a set of keys to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> different locks, according to the requirements and regulations of the company.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO\">2000 Pan African MO</a></b> (<b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Pan African MO</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2001 Pan African MO\">2001 Pan African MO</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Pan African MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Pan African MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190236\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 243/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 901/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 75/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6612/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.561      1 Template:Pan_African_MO_box\n100.00%    9.561      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17890:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190236 and revision id 112525. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}